mes flee clients refrain  from getting a cleaning session if they  have witnessed the cleaning session of  the previous client ending badly  cleaners give the impression of trying  to maintain a good reputation because  they cheat less when they see a big  audience or a long queue of clients  watching cleaners sometimes work as male  female teens and when the smaller female  cheats and bites the client the larger  male chases her off as if to punish her  for having tarnished their reputation an  amazing case of business savvy animals  in this underwater beauty salon  what fish mainly think about is food and  the pursuit of staying alive but the way  they plan and go about life shows that  they are capable of intelligence and  while you're watching this video your  goldfish is only getting smarter I hope  that knowledge that fish are not just  inanimate floating pieces of flesh  causes you to imagine they're more  complexly and change the way you treat  marine life and the ocean
 

